"interfața camerei etc.) după nume și câmp de biți::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/debugging.rst:138
msgid ""
"For STM32 and MIMXRT, get the SVD from the ST / NXP CMSIS packs or the "
"Cortex-Debug SVD registry. The Alif SVDs are vendored in the firmware repo "
"at ``lib/micropython/lib/alif_ensemble-cmsis-dfp/Debug/SVD/`` (use the "
